 flip  the switch and kill zombies in the red  circle after it lights up orange head  back upstairs  step 5 collect the parts once you're  back upstairs head to the far end of the  room go up the stairs and hit the button  the guyst craft transfer device will  either head to the lab or the more for  us it went to the lab first follow it  and continue to kill zombies within the  circle once it reaches the end and the  machine is done doing whatever it's  doing grab the part and head back to the  center now you're gonna have to do the  same thing on the other side step 6  build the Tesla gun return to the centre  of the bunker and assemble the Tesla gun  don't worry everyone in your squad will  get one of these fancy killing machines  there is still much more to this zombie  map that we are still figuring out let  us know if you'd like to see more in the  future and thank you for watching  [Music]
 

